a/commons/1/12/2021-08-29_-_FIFA_Beach_Soccer_World_Cup_-_Match_32_-_Russian_Football_Union_v_Japan_-_Team_RFU_anthem.webm?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original", "image_url": "https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/12/2021-08-29_-_FIFA_Beach_Soccer_World_Cup_-_Match_32_-_Russian_Football_Union_v_Japan_-_Team_RFU_anthem.webm/960px--2021-08-29_-_FIFA_Beach_Soccer_World_Cup_-_Match_32_-_Russian_Football_Union_v_Japan_-_Team_RFU_anthem.webm.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo", "video_url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/1/12/2021-08-29_-_FIFA_Beach_Soccer_World_Cup_-_Match_32_-_Russian_Football_Union_v_Japan_-_Team_RFU_anthem.webm?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original", "thumbnail_url": "https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/12/2021-08-29_-_FIFA_Beach_Soccer_World_Cup_-_Match_32_-_Russian_Football_Union_v_Japan_-_Team_RFU_anthem.webm/960px--2021-08-29_-_FIFA_Beach_Soccer_World_Cup_-_Match_32_-_Russian_Football_Union_v_Japan_-_Team_RFU_anthem.webm.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo", "duration_secs": 0, "downloadable": true, "category": "Sports", "topic": "soccer", "content_type": "video", "lang": "en", "tags": ["Sports", "Wikimedia Commons", "en", "soccer", "video", "旅行探店", "足球"], "excerpt": "Freely-licensed video from Wikimedia", "published_at": "2023-12-24T17:49:28Z", "curated_at": "2026-09-11T20:05:13Z", "body": "bodies/feed-a52e27d56c8b.json", "engagement": 150, "opens": 0, "upvotes": 0}, {"id": "feed-03c9dfad2f31", "title": "早报｜GPT-6 Sol发布，价格腰斩/特努斯：Siri AI不应代替人际关系/4999起，OPPO Find X10系列发布", "source": "爱范儿", "author": "郑廷旭", "url": "https://www.ifanr.com/1681566?utm_source=rss&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=", "image_url": "https://s3.ifanr.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/img_6ab317bcc9060.jpeg", "video_url": null, "thumbnail_url": null, "duration_secs": 0, "downloadable": false, "category": "Tech", "topic": "zh_tech", "content_type": "text", "lang": "zh", "tags": ["Tech", "text", "zh", "zh_tech", "爱范儿", "科技"], "excerpt": "\n‍GPT-6 Sol 与 Luna 发布，API 价格降低 50%\n\n\nClaude Opus 5.5 发布，典型任务运行成本降低 40%\n\n\n特努斯：Siri AI 不应代替人际关系\n\n\nOPPO Find X10 系列发布：4999 元起，标准版配备双 2 亿像素镜头\n\n\n第六代骁龙 8 双旗舰发布，iQOO", "published_at": "2026-09-23T00:05:46Z", "curated_at": "2026-09-23T11:11:57Z", "body": "bodies/feed-03c9dfad2f31.json", "engagement": 210, "opens": 0, "upvotes": 0}, {"id": "feed-1eb9756bcb51", "title": "剪映，杀入 AI 互动影游", "source": "极客公园", "author": "", "url": "http://www.geekpark.net/news/370883", "image_url": "https://imgslim.geekpark.net/uploads/image/file/6f/8f/6f8f0996ff90144cefd62935f0067d1d.jpg", "video_url": null, "thumbnail_url": null, "duration_secs": 0, "downloadable": false, "category": "Tech", "topic": "zh_tech", "content_type": "text", "lang": "zh", "tags": ["Tech", "text", "zh", "zh_tech", "极客公园", "科技"], "excerpt": "\n头图来源：剪映\n\n\n9 月 20 日，剪映在「AI 新创作发布会」上，集中更新了专业版、移动端和创作者生态。\n\n\n专业版新增一站式创作工作台「剪映", "published_at": "2026-09-23T07:32:36Z", "curated_at": "2026-09-23T11:11:57Z", "body": "bodies/feed-1eb9756bcb51.json", "engagement": 140, "opens": 0, "upvotes": 0}, {"id": "feed-20156215e534", "title": "做一个能自迭代的后训练平台，Mind Lab要让更多企业拥有自己的模型", "source": "36氪", "author": "", "url": "https://36kr.com/p/3995795643142020?f=rss", "image_url": "https://img.36krcdn.com/hsossms/20260923/v2_7b841ed669d64752a56757e8d1e22579@6162492_oswg110173oswg1080oswg810_img_000?x-oss-process=image/format,jpg/interlace,1", "video_url": null, "thumbnail_url": null, "duration_secs": 0, "downloadable": false, "category": "Tech", "topic": "zh_tech", "content_type": "text", "lang": "zh", "tags": ["36氪", "Tech", "text", "zh", "zh_tech", "健身"], "excerpt": "文｜王欣逸\n\n\n编辑｜张雨忻\n\n\n如果你近期有和投资人闲聊两句，会得出这样一个结论：AI圈的关注点再一次回到了模型和AI Infra（基础设施）。模型，对应着时下应用遇冷，热度向上游转移；而AI Infra的关注点之一，是后训练平台和推理平台。\n\n\n昨天，Mind", "published_at": "2026-09-23T11:10:27Z", "curated_at": "2026-09-23T11:11:57Z", "body": "bodies/feed-20156215e534.json", "engagement": 170, "opens": 0, "upvotes": 0}, {"id": "feed-2eb55ed2b8c1", "title": "Where can Australians buy R18+ PC games without a credit card? Pretty much everywhere but Steam", "source": "PC Gamer", "author": "shaun.prescott@futurenet.com (Shaun Prescott)", "url": "https://www.pcgamer.com/software/platforms/how-to-buy-r18-games-without-a-credit-card/", "image_url": "https://cdn.mos.cms.futurecdn.net/DZKZDSWUzBbPNghUTiW3bc-1920-80.jpg", "video_url": null, "thumbnail_url": null, "duration_secs": 0, "downloadable": false, "category": "Entertainment", "topic": "gaming", "content_type": "text", "lang": "en", "tags": ["Entertainment", "PC Gamer", "en", "gaming", "text", "游戏"], "excerpt": "\nValve implemented age verification for Australian Steam users earlier this month, which was inevitable: Australian law demands it. Unfortunately, Valve has", "published_at": "2026-09-23T03:38:59Z", "curated_at": "2026-09-23T11:11:57Z", "body": "bodies/feed-2eb55ed2b8c1.json", "engagement": 120, "opens": 0, "upvotes": 0}, {"id": "feed-3bb8e8d3d190", "title": "Apple’s New iPhone Duo Is Packed with Design-Nerd Details", "source": "GQ", "author": "Robert Leedham", "url": "https://www.gq.com/story/iphone-duo-john-ternus", "image_url": "https://media.gq.com/photos/6ab282325ef45bb42d8b07df/master/pass/iPhone-Duo-hp.jpg", "video_url": null, "thumbnail_url": null, "duration_secs": 0, "downloadable": false, "category": "Lifestyle", "topic": "style", "content_type": "text", "lang": "en", "tags": ["GQ", "Lifestyle", "en", "style", "text", "科技"], "excerpt": "To understand the iPhone Duo and its ability to turn sceptics into believers, you could do a whole lot worse than crib from the wisdom of Jay-Z. Sure, Steve", "published_at": "2026-09-22T18:44:35Z", "curated_at": "2026-09-23T11:11:57Z", "body": "bodies/feed-3bb8e8d3d190.json", "engagement": 120, "opens": 0, "upvotes": 0}, {"id": "feed-49621453e152", "title": "⁡⁤‬‍⁤‬​‌‍⁢⁡⁢⁣‌‌﻿⁡⁡​⁤​​﻿⁢⁡‬⁡‬​‍⁣​​﻿⁤⁡‍​⁡‬‌‬⁣⁡⁣​⁡‬⁤刚刚，GPT-6 新模型掀桌！「白菜价」杀进 DeepSeek 腹地", "source": "爱范儿", "author": "莫崇宇", "url": "https://www.ifanr.com/1681605?utm_source=rss&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=", "image_url": "https://s3.ifanr.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/14-5.png", "video_url": null, "thumbnail_url": null, "duration_secs": 0, "downloadable": false, "category": "Tech", "topic": "zh_tech", "content_type": "text", "lang": "zh", "tags": ["Tech", "text", "zh", "zh_tech", "爱范儿", "科技"], "excerpt": "\nDeepSeek 快醒醒，ChatGPT 要打到家门口了。\n\n\n就在刚刚，OpenAI 正式发布 GPT-6 Sol 和 GPT-6 Luna，API 价格降至上一代的一半左右。其中，Luna 每百万 Token 输入 0.1 美元、输出 0.5 美元，约合人民币 0.7 元和 3.5", "published_at": "2026-09-23T02:21:17Z", "curated_at": "2026-09-23T11:11:57Z", "body": "bodies/feed-49621453e152.json", "engagement": 160, "opens": 0, "upvotes": 0}, {"id": "feed-4a661b8cd8aa", "title": "NBC’s “Line of Fire” Puts a Family of Law Enforcement in Each Other’s Crosshairs", "source": "RogerEbert.com", "author": "Sherin Nicole", "url": "https://www.rogerebert.com/streaming/line-of-fire-nbc-tv-review-2026", "image_url": null, "video_url": null, "thumbnail_url": null, "duration_secs": 0, "downloadable": false, "category": "Entertainment", "topic": "film", "content_type": "text", "lang": "en", "tags": ["Entertainment", "RogerEbert.com", "en", "film", "text", "投资"], "excerpt": "\nNothing sets up the new NBC/Peacock series “Line of Fire” better than the tagline, Every Case Hits Home. Except, of course, for one quote from the first", "published_at": "2026-09-21T18:49:39Z", "curated_at": "2026-09-23T11:11:57Z", "body": "bodies/feed-4a661b8cd8aa.json", "engagement": 110, "opens": 0, "upvotes": 0}, {"id": "feed-5800fd08c2db", "title": "\"Good luck today, Halo friends\": After years of rivalry, Call of Duty's creators have taken charge of Xbox's defining FPS series amid yet more layoffs", "source": "Rock Paper Shotgun", "author": "Edwin Evans-Thirlwell", "url": "https://www.rockpapershotgun.com/good-luck-today-halo-friends-after-years-of-rivalry-call-of-dutys-creators-have-taken-charge-of-xboxs-defining-fps-series-amid-yet-more-layoffs", "image_url": "https://assetsio.gnwcdn.com/halo-2-anniversary-20-years-1.jpg?width=690&quality=85&format=jpg&auto=webp", "video_url": null, "thumbnail_url": null, "duration_secs": 0, "downloadable": false, "category": "Entertainment", "topic": "gaming", "content_type": "text", "lang": "en", "tags": ["Entertainment", "Rock Paper Shotgun", "en", "gaming", "text", "游戏"], "excerpt": "For decades, Halo developers have resisted the influence of the vastly better-selling Call of Duty shooters. Now, the makers of Call of Duty own Halo. As part", "published_at": "2026-09-22T15:18:58Z", "curated_at": "2026-09-23T11:11:57Z", "body": "bodies/feed-5800fd08c2db.json", "engagement": 110, "opens": 0, "upvotes": 0}, {"id": "feed-5d756d5f1cc7", "title": "8点1氪丨雷军否认打新宇树挣100亿；罗永浩宣布播客暂停更新；Meta Muse爆火，扎克伯格身价一日暴涨1600亿元", "source": "36氪", "author": "", "url": "https://36kr.com/p/3995341472125056?f=rss", "image_url": null, "video_url": null, "thumbnail_url": null, "duration_secs": 0, "downloadable": false, "category": "Tech", "topic": "zh_tech", "content_type": "text", "lang": "zh", "tags": ["36氪", "Tech", "text", "zh", "zh_tech", "科技"], "excerpt": "今日热点导览\n\n\n贝森特将Hugging", "published_at": "2026-09-23T11:10:27Z", "curated_at": "2026-09-23T11:11:57Z", "body": "bodies/feed-5d756d5f1cc7.json", "engagement": 210, "opens": 0, "upvotes": 0}, {"id": "feed-771a56223f3c", "title": "从 iPhone 18 开始，苹果给你的照片打上「看不见」的水印", "source": "爱范儿", "author": "罗嘉阳", "url": "https://www.ifanr.com/1681780?utm_source=rss&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=", "image_url": "https://s3.ifanr.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/img_6ab397990e289.png", "video_url": null, "thumbnail_url": null, "duration_secs": 0, "downloadable": false, "category": "Tech", "topic": "zh_tech", "content_type": "text", "lang": "zh", "tags": ["Tech", "text", "zh", "zh_tech", "爱范儿", "科技"], "excerpt": "\n大约两百年前，法国人尼埃普斯将一块涂有感光材料的白镴板放进暗箱，对准窗外。\n\n\n光线穿过镜头，落在这块金属板上。经过漫长的曝光，窗外的风景留下了一些模糊的明暗。这张《窗外的勒格拉景色》，通常被